<title>AUSTRIA: Austria c.bank allots 7.42 bln ATS in 2-wk repos.</title>
<headline>Austria c.bank allots 7.42 bln ATS in 2-wk repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it had allocated 7.42 billion schillings in two-week securities repurchase agreements at a fixed and unchanged rate of 3.0 percent.</p>
<p>The central bank said six percent of bids were filled.</p>
<p>Last week, the bank allotted 16.98 billion schillings in repos, filling 14 percent of bids. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
</text>
